# # /monarch-initiative/
#
# https://w3id.org/monarch-initiative/ redirects to https://monarchinitiative.org/
# https://w3id.org/monarch-initiative/entity/<id> redirects to https://monarchinitiative.org/<id>
# https://w3id.org/monarch-initiative/<path> redirects to https://monarch-initiative.github.io/<path>
#
